<title>USA: Chile's CTC sets Q3 dividend.</title>
<headline>Chile's CTC sets Q3 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compania de Telecomunicaciones de Chile SA said on Friday its third interim dividend will total $0.47 per ADR payable November 21, 1996 to shareholders of record as of November 14.</p>
<p>The gross dividend prior to a withholding tax of 23.5 percent is $0.62 per ADR, the Santiago-based company said.</p>
<p>The prior dividend was $0.386 per ADR.</p>
</text>
